# Commit and push

After finishing meaningful site changes in this portfolio repo, always create a git commit and push to `origin` on the current branch without waiting to be asked.

- Include all relevant changed and new files (HTML, CSS, JS, images, favicons, resume assets).
- Use a concise commit message focused on why the change was made.
- Do not force-push, amend remote commits, or skip hooks.
- Run `git status` after push to confirm the branch is clean and up to date with the remote.
